{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17116","headline":"赋得金茎露 · 徐敞","name":"赋得金茎露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武帝贵长生，延年饵玉英。\n铜盘贮珠露，仙掌抗金茎。\n拂曙氛埃敛，凌空沆瀣清。\n迢嶤捧瑞气，巃嵸出宫城。\n势入浮云耸，形标霁色明。\n大君当御宇，何必去蓬瀛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐敞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}